<title>POLAND: Debica to lay off 5 percent of employees.</title>
<headline>Debica to lay off 5 percent of employees.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish tyre maker Debica SA will dismiss 239 people, or five percent of its employees, in December this year and in the first quarter of 1997, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said it had consulted with the trade unions over the lay-offs, which resulted from internal organisational changes. It said the dismissals would help it reduce costs.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
